          "value": "<p>Shadows coalesce around Darkscale and transport him through the Shadow Plane to an area of darkness or low-light within 120ft. This movement does not trigger reactions.</p><p>Darkscale can always sense the presence or absence of shadows within the range of Shadow Jump, and doesn't need line of sight to a location to target it with Shadow Jump.</p>"
