        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>Darkscale unleashes shadows that permeate the arena and last for 1 round. Enemies inside these shadows must make a @Check[type:will|dc:27] save. On a failure, they are affected by a 4th-rank @Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.r8g7oSumKOHDqJsd]{Agitate} spell as if they had failed the save against the spell.</p><p>These shadows do not affect the light level of the arena, but they prevent enemies from seeing further than 10 feet away from them unless they have greater darkvision.</p>"
